<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 1.0 trln yen of 2.6% 10-year JGBs.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 1.0 trln yen of 2.6% 10-year JGBs.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) on Tuesday offered 1.0 trillion yen of 2.6 percent 10-year government bonds through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be March 21, 1997 and the maturity date March 20, 2007.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
